WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.567
-Well, guys,
it's the last day of October,

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:04.400
so I thought it'd be nice
to give a little recap

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.434
of the entire month.
Here we go.

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:10.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:15.834
♪ October is over, so ♪

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:18.267
♪ Ten months down
and two to go ♪

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:20.167
♪ We're all focused
on one person ♪

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:21.167
♪ She made... ♪

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:23.601
-"1989 (Taylor's Version)"

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:26.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.000
-♪ Congress couldn't
find a speaker ♪

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.267
♪ Our country
was down a leader ♪

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:33.667
♪ Tempers, they began to flare
like ♪

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:36.634
-Subject to the call
of the chair.

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:37.634
[ Gavel bangs loudly ]

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:40.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.501
-♪ "Golden Bachelor" is great ♪

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:44.367
♪ Love to watch him
go on dates ♪

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.300
♪ But the women
sometimes fight ♪

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.601
♪ And Gary
cannot drive at night ♪

00:00:50.267 --> 00:00:51.901
[ Truck horn honks ]

00:00:51.901 --> 00:00:55.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:00.968
♪ We saw "Saw" and "Exorcist" ♪

00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:03.300
♪ "Five Nights at Freddy's"
was legit ♪

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:05.334
♪ There was so much stuff
to scare us ♪

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:06.701
♪ But not as bad as... ♪

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:10.200
-A bedbug infestation in Paris.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.300
-♪ Trump spent every day
in court ♪

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.334
♪ Mike Pence
cut his campaign short ♪

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:16.300
♪ The whole thing
was kind of strange ♪

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.133
♪ Just like ♪
-"The Star Spangled Banner,"

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.934
performed tonight
by Flavor Flav.

00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:21.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.467
-♪ iPhone 15 overheats ♪

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:25.501
♪ Keeps you warm
for trick-or-treat ♪

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:27.400
♪ We dress up for Halloween ♪

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.601
♪ I'll go as ♪

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:30.100
-The Kevin James meme.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:34.601
-♪ Another month
has come and gone ♪

00:01:34.601 --> 00:01:36.501
♪ Leaves are falling
on your lawn ♪

00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:38.767
♪ November will be better,
surely ♪

00:01:38.767 --> 00:01:41.968
♪ Unless you are
a freakin' turkey ♪

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:45.467
I'll play this one day.

